# Header rules for the LANDING origin (mashpotato.app).
#
# Much tighter than the app's, because this is a few static files: no API
# calls, no images beyond our own, and no scripts of ours. The one script
# allowed is Cloudflare Web Analytics, which Cloudflare injects into pages it
# serves (cookieless visit counts, disclosed in privacy.html); it reports to
# cloudflareinsights.com. If this page ever needs JavaScript of its own, that
# is the moment to ask whether it still belongs on a static marketing site.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://cloudflareinsights.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), interest-cohort=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
